7-x3-hq"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I placed a single purchase order for the new hires, PO0001, shipping to HQ. It totals $1,584.\n\n- **USB-C docks: 3 \u00d7 DK-210** ($199 each, $597). The DK-200 had no new stock, only a refurbished unit (DK-200-R), so I used the approved successor DK-210, which is new.\n- **Monitors: 3 \u00d7 MN-27** (27-inch 4K, $329 each, $987). Both are new, not refurbished.\n\nThe total is under the $2,500 threshold, so no manager approval was needed. I shipped to \"HQ\" as written since I don't have a street address on file; confirm the delivery location if the receiving team needs a specific address.", "type": "text"}]}]}